# Keeps command-center/receipts/ in git even when empty. CC-0002 requires this directory to be a
# committed substrate, not one that happens to exist on one machine. Deliberately NOT a 0-byte
# file: on this box a 0-byte file is the MSYS redirect-truncation signature, and the program's own
# delivered() predicate treats size<=0 as a failure state worth distinguishing.
